    "units": "Pa/degC^2"
   }
  },
  "wright_coeff_b3": {
   "description": "The Wright EOS fit parameter b3 = 1.660557e2 Pa degC-3 (MOM_EOS_Wright_full.F90:29). Shared by reference with mom6_eos.esm's WrightEOS (see wright_coeff_a0).",
   "params": [],
